        "title": "SCP | ASSEMBLY | DD RHW-4 — Modular Diagonal Avenue Diamond — Compact",
        "variant_label": "Compact",
        "description": "Start with the highway stamp. Tab and Shift+Tab select the four full compact ramps and two compact Avenue junctions. Home and End rotate each part. Each click places one component."
